                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I played the demo. It was great. I was looking forward to this but after playing full game, feel very disappointed. Excruciatingly short, only slightly longer than the demo. Almost zero character development. This character is doing that and another character doing the opposite,which one you will follow? Almost couldn't care of what is happening at all. Story progressed way too fast. Disappointed as author's previous release was extremely good and with promising demo, fell awfully short of expectation.\n\n3/10 Best of Us? Definitely not.",
